                                <section class="section" id="faq">
                                  <div class="container">
                                    <div class="section-head section-head--center reveal">
                                      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--center">Owner questions</span>
                                      <h2 class="section-title">Answers before you sign</h2>
                                      <p class="section-sub">The things owners ask us most. Still curious? Book a call and we'll walk through your
                                        specific property.</p>
                                      </div>

                                      <div class="faq-list reveal">
                                        <div class="faq-item">
                                          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false"><span>What does Cornerstone charge?</span><span
                                            class="faq-q__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
                                            <div class="faq-a">
                                              <div class="faq-a__inner">
                                                <p>Our core management fee is a flat 8% of collected rent, with a one-time leasing fee equal to 50% of the
                                                  first month's rent when we place a new resident. There are no markups on maintenance, no setup fees and
                                                  no charge during vacancy — if you don't get paid, we don't get paid.</p>
                                                </div>
                                              </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="faq-item">
                                              <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false"><span>How quickly can you lease my vacant unit?</span><span
                                                class="faq-q__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
                                                <div class="faq-a">
                                                  <div class="faq-a__inner">
                                                    <p>Our current portfolio average is 21 days from listing to signed lease. We photograph the property
                                                      professionally, syndicate to more than 40 rental sites the same day, and offer weekend and evening
                                                      showings. Well-priced homes in strong neighborhoods frequently lease in under two weeks.</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                  </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="faq-item">
                                                  <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false"><span>How do you screen tenants?</span><span class="faq-q__icon"
                                                                                                                                             aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
                                                    <div class="faq-a">
                                                      <div class="faq-a__inner">
                                                        <p>Every adult applicant undergoes a full credit check, income verification (typically 3x rent),
                                                          nationwide criminal and eviction history, and direct contact with previous landlords. We apply
                                                          consistent, fair-housing-compliant criteria to every applicant and document each decision so you're
                                                          always protected.</p>
                                                        </div>
                                                      </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="faq-item">
                                                      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false"><span>When and how do I get paid?</span><span class="faq-q__icon"
                                                                                                                                                  aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
                                                        <div class="faq-a">
                                                          <div class="faq-a__inner">
                                                            <p>Rent is due on the 1st, and after clearing we deposit your proceeds by direct deposit no later than the
                                                              10th of each month. Your owner portal shows a live statement with every payment and expense itemized,
                                                              and year-end 1099 tax documents are generated automatically.</p>
                                                            </div>
                                                          </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="faq-item">
                                                          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false"><span>Who handles maintenance and repairs?</span><span
                                                            class="faq-q__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
                                                            <div class="faq-a">
                                                              <div class="faq-a__inner">
                                                                <p>We do. Residents submit requests through their portal, and our team dispatches from a vetted network of
                                                                  licensed, insured vendors. Routine repairs under your pre-set spending limit are handled without
                                                                  interrupting you; anything larger comes to you for approval first, with photos and a quote.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                              </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="faq-item">
                                                              <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false"><span>What happens if a tenant stops paying?</span><span
                                                                class="faq-q__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
                                                                <div class="faq-a">
                                                                  <div class="faq-a__inner">
                                                                    <p>We enforce late fees automatically and begin communication immediately. If it escalates, our in-house
                                                                      team manages the entire eviction process — notices, filings and court coordination — following local law
                                                                      precisely. Owners on our protection plan are covered for eligible court and filing costs.</p>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                  </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="faq-item">
                                                                  <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false"><span>Am I locked into a long contract?</span><span
                                                                    class="faq-q__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
                                                                    <div class="faq-a">
                                                                      <div class="faq-a__inner">
                                                                        <p>No. Our management agreement runs month-to-month after an initial term, and you can cancel with 30
                                                                          days' written notice without penalty. We'd rather earn your business every month than trap you in a
                                                                          contract you regret.</p>
                                                                        </div>
                                                                      </div>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                  </div>
                                                                </div>
